@host = http://localhost:5254

### List categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Create a category
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Food",
  "color": "#D62E2F"
}

### Create an expense (use the category id returned above)
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25000,
  "date": "2026-11-01",
  "note": "Lunch",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### List expenses for a month
GET {{host}}/api/expenses?month=2026-11